  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/10/IMG_4973.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>El Casal Jove de Onda ha acogido este s&aacute;bado la segunda y &uacute;ltima jornada de la II Feria de Asociaciones, en la que ha tenido un protagonismo especial Adaponda, con una gymkana y varios juegos deportivos. El grupo musical CV-10 ha cerrado por la noche el evento.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firaassociacions14dissabtecasaljove/img_4947.jpg\" alt=\"img_4947\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firaassociacions14dissabtecasaljove/img_4949.jpg\" alt=\"img_4949\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firaassociacions14dissabtecasaljove/img_4951.jpg\" alt=\"img_4951\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firaassociacions14dissabtecasaljove/img_4952.jpg\" alt=\"img_4952\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firaassociacions14dissabtecasaljove/img_4953.jpg\" alt=\"img_4953\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firaassociacions14dissabtecasaljove/img_4954.jpg\" alt=\"img_4954\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firaassociacions14dissabtecasaljove/img_4955.jpg\" alt=\"img_4955\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firaassociacions14dissabtecasaljove/img_4956.jpg\" alt=\"img_4956\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firaassociacions14dissabtecasaljove/im